 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "We groan inwardly in our weakness",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.05,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Waiting for redemption of our bodies",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.85,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We do not know what to pray for",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As we ought in this dark place",
   "heard": 0,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": null,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "What to pray for, as we are in this dark place",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 7.97,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But the Spirit helps us in our frailty",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 6.34,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He intercedes for the saints",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 6.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "With groanings too deep for words",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 5.96,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He prays to the Father above",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 3.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The Spirit intercedes for us",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "According to God's holy will",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He who searches our hearts knows",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The mind of the Spirit is clear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He pleads on our behalf always",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For those who are called by name",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With groanings too deep for words",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He prays to the Father above",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Spirit intercedes for us",
